---
---

<section class="hero">
	<div class="status-pill">
		<span class="dot"></span>Currently learning · 42 School · Paris
	</div>
	<div class="hero-content">
		<h1>I'm <span class="accent">ficelo</span>,<br /> a junior game designer & developer.</h1>
		<p>With my games, I'm exploring ways to leave a mark. Small projects and a lot of fun — trying to do better every time.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-meta">
		<span><strong>Based</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Paris, Fr</span>
		<span class="separator">|</span>
		<span><strong>School</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;42 (In progress)</span>
		<span class="separator">|</span>
		<span><strong>Currently</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Rust · Bevy · Ts</span>
		<span class="separator">|</span>
		<span><strong>Looking for</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;First internship</span>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-cta">
		<a href="#work" class="primary">See my work <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
		<a href="#contact" class="secondary">Say hi ! <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>

	.hero {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: flex-start;

		gap: 2.2rem;
		padding: 4rem 6% 5rem;
		min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
	}

	.hero-meta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-direction: column;

		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(243,246,246, 0.62);
	}

	.hero-meta strong {
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.hero-content h1 {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 4rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	.hero-content p {
		font-size: clamp(1.0rem, 1.5vw, 2rem);
		max-width: 66ch;
		color: rgba(243, 246, 246, 0.72);
	}

	.status-pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		border: 1px solid;
		padding: 0.4rem .8rem;
		color: var(--color-secondary);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		gap: 0.7rem;
	}

	.status-pill .dot {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 12px;
		height: 12px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--color-accent);
		animation: breath 1.25s infinite alternate;
	}

	 @keyframes breath{
		from {
			opacity: 40%;
		}
		to {
			opacity: 100%;
		}
	}

	.hero-cta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
	}

	.hero-cta a {
		text-decoration: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
	}

	.primary {
		color: var(--color-text);
		border: 2px solid;
	}

	.primary:hover {
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-bg);
	}

	.secondary {
		color: var(--color-text);
		opacity: 70%;
	}

	.secondary:hover {
		opacity: 100%;
	}

	.arrow {
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.hero-cta a:hover .arrow {
		transform: translateX(0.3em);
	}

	.accent {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.separator {
		color: var(--color-secondary);
		display: none;
	}

	@media(min-width: 768px) {
		.hero-cta { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 5rem; }
		.hero-meta { font-size: 1.05rem; flex-direction: row; gap: 1.5rem; }
		.separator { display: block;}
		.status-pill { font-size: 1.05rem; }
	}

</style>
